			x: 6.0d,
			y: -2.0d,
			optional: true,
			title: "A Carpenter",
			description: ["Build the Carpenter's Workshop, a little house with a crafting table, and sneak-right-click a villager by it holding planks. Get its blueprint at the Blueprint Table (pick it, press Get Blueprint: it takes a Blank Blueprint), right-click the ground where its front goes, stock the chests within 8 blocks of the table with what the blueprint lists when you hold Shift over it, and right-click your builder with it. A build shown greyed out at the Table isn't unlocked yet: the Table says how to get it.", "", "When a build is short of something that can be crafted (doors, stairs, fences...), the carpenter makes it."],
			dependencies: ["1D5A78DCEAAACF0B"],
			icon: {id: "minecraft:crafting_table", count: 1},
