			x: 6.0d,
			y: 2.0d,
			optional: true,
			title: "A Miner",
			description: ["Build the Smithy, a stone forge with a blast furnace, and sneak-right-click a villager by the blast furnace holding a pickaxe. Get its blueprint at the Blueprint Table (pick it, press Get Blueprint: it takes a Blank Blueprint), right-click the ground where its front goes, stock the chests within 8 blocks of the table with what the blueprint lists when you hold Shift over it, and right-click your builder with it. A build shown greyed out at the Table isn't unlocked yet: the Table says how to get it.", "", "A stick, red dye and paper make a Quarry Marker: it tells the miner where to dig."],
