		{
			id: "41A60CA4BB946FF8",
			x: 6.0d,
			y: 4.0d,
			optional: true,
			title: "A Mason",
			description: ["Build the Mason's Yard, a fenced yard with a stonecutter. A villager without a job takes it and cuts the stone, glass and bricks your builders wait for. Get its blueprint at the Blueprint Table (pick it, press Get Blueprint: it takes a Blank Blueprint), right-click the ground where its front goes, stock the chests within 8 blocks of the table with what the blueprint lists when you hold Shift over it, and right-click your builder with it. A build shown greyed out at the Table isn't unlocked yet: the Table says how to get it."],
