			y: 2.0d,
			optional: true,
			title: "Pokémon at work",
			description: ["Keep Pokémon in a Pasture Block within 16 blocks of a worker's workstation. If their type suits the job, each one makes the work go faster, up to three helpers: Fighting, Rock and Steel help builders, Grass, Ground and Water help farmers.", "", "The line over the worker's head says who's helping (\"· with Machop\")."],
